Based on the following interaction sequence, summarize the agent's actions and the resulting observations. The observations are directly caused by the actions taken by the agent. Your summary should accurately and concisely communicate both the actions performed by the agent as well as the results of those actions; that is, explain what happened so that another agent can understand without seeing the original interaction sequence, below.

Agent Actions:
{actions}

Resulting Observations:
{observations}

Your response should be a single Markdown code block, like this: ```<summary of agent actions and observations>```. Write it in 3rd person, referring to the actions completed without referencing either the user or the agent ("this was done" rather than "I did this" or "agent did this").
